name    sol
prog    sol
# The deal, one thumb of the deck, the help screen, then quit.
rate    0.5
size    24 80
wait    6
snap    start
key     t
key     \r
wait    3
snap    thumbed
key     h
key     \r
wait    3
snap    help
key     \r
wait    3
key     q
key     \r
wait    4
expect  cmd:
expect  thumb the deck
expect  I see you gave up
